1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:04,489
Jerusalem. Winter. The
Feast of Dedication.

2
00:00:04,633 --> 00:00:09,143
In Solomon's Colonnade, the religious
leaders gathered around him.

3
00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:11,560
How long will you
keep us in suspense?

4
00:00:11,570 --> 00:00:14,120
If you are the Messiah,
tell us plainly.

5
00:00:14,610 --> 00:00:17,440
I did tell you, but
you do not believe.

6
00:00:17,870 --> 00:00:22,440
The works I do in my Father's
name testify about me,

7
00:00:22,243 --> 00:00:26,213
but you do not believe,
because you are not my sheep.

8
00:00:26,670 --> 00:00:31,920
My sheep listen to my voice; I
know them, and they follow me.

9
00:00:32,050 --> 00:00:36,500
I give them eternal life,
and they shall never perish;

10
00:00:36,505 --> 00:00:39,575
no one will snatch
them out of my hand.

11
00:00:39,925 --> 00:00:44,355
My Father, who has given them
to me, is greater than all;

12
00:00:44,298 --> 00:00:47,708
no one can snatch them
out of my Father's hand.

13
00:00:48,345 --> 00:00:50,995
I and the Father are one.

14
00:00:53,598 --> 00:00:57,928
Again his Pharisee opponents
picked up stones to stone him.

15
00:00:58,146 --> 00:01:01,756
I have shown you many good
works from the Father.

16
00:01:02,006 --> 00:01:04,396
For which of these
do you stone me?

17
00:01:04,686 --> 00:01:08,756
We are not stoning you for any
good work, but for blasphemy,

18
00:01:08,846 --> 00:01:12,096
because you, a mere
man, claim to be God.

19
00:01:12,493 --> 00:01:17,543
Is it not written in your Law,
'I have said you are "gods"'?

20
00:01:17,444 --> 00:01:21,674
If he called them 'gods,' to
whom the word of God came,

21
00:01:21,744 --> 00:01:24,254
and Scripture cannot be set aside,

22
00:01:24,384 --> 00:01:30,134
what about the one whom the Father
set apart as his very own and

23
00:01:29,704 --> 00:01:31,234
sent into the world?

24
00:01:31,437 --> 00:01:36,367
Why then do you accuse me
of blasphemy because I said,

25
00:01:36,054 --> 00:01:38,162
'I am God's Son'?

26
00:01:38,332 --> 00:01:42,862
Do not believe me unless I
do the works of my Father.

27
00:01:42,979 --> 00:01:46,469
But if I do them, even
though you do not believe me,

28
00:01:46,559 --> 00:01:47,589
believe the works,

29
00:01:47,746 --> 00:01:52,636
that you may know and understand
that the Father is in me,

30
00:01:52,726 --> 00:01:54,516
and I in the Father.

31
00:01:56,679 --> 00:01:57,749
Take him.

32
00:01:57,688 --> 00:02:02,338
Again they tried to seize him,
but he escaped their grasp.

33
00:02:02,908 --> 00:02:04,498
You dropped your stone.

34
00:02:04,968 --> 00:02:07,978
Have you ever seen
a man born blind...

35
00:02:07,548 --> 00:02:08,778
open his eyes?

36
00:02:10,481 --> 00:02:12,851
Teacher! They would
have killed you!

37
00:02:12,850 --> 00:02:15,160
It is not yet my time, Peter.

38
00:02:15,403 --> 00:02:16,633
And when it does?

39
00:02:17,116 --> 00:02:19,406
Do not be afraid, John.

40
00:02:21,644 --> 00:02:24,654
Months later. The
night before the cross.

41
00:02:24,887 --> 00:02:29,357
He looked toward heaven and
prayed, while his friends listened.

42
00:02:29,759 --> 00:02:32,789
My prayer is not for them alone.

43
00:02:32,950 --> 00:02:37,560
I pray also for those who will
believe in me through their

44
00:02:37,130 --> 00:02:38,040
message,

45
00:02:39,036 --> 00:02:43,466
Two thousand years later,
people still read that prayer,

46
00:02:43,316 --> 00:02:45,246
and find themselves in it.

47
00:02:45,508 --> 00:02:47,458
He prayed... for me?

48
00:02:48,047 --> 00:02:50,677
that all of them
may be one, Father,

49
00:02:50,887 --> 00:02:54,257
just as you are in
me and I am in you.

50
00:02:54,226 --> 00:02:59,216
May they also be in us so that the
world may believe that you have

51
00:02:58,786 --> 00:02:59,776
sent me.

52
00:03:00,346 --> 00:03:04,156
I have given them the
glory that you gave me,

53
00:03:04,206 --> 00:03:07,556
that they may be
one as we are one,

54
00:03:07,526 --> 00:03:10,996
I in them and you in me,

55
00:03:10,866 --> 00:03:14,296
so that they may be
brought to complete unity.

56
00:03:16,134 --> 00:03:16,844
Hello?

57
00:03:17,361 --> 00:03:21,991
Hey. It's me. I'm so sorry...
for what I said at Dad's funeral.

58
00:03:22,488 --> 00:03:25,838
I've picked up the phone to
call you a hundred times.

59
00:03:26,321 --> 00:03:27,611
Can I come over?

60
00:03:27,708 --> 00:03:28,838
The door's open.

61
00:03:29,881 --> 00:03:34,991
Then the world will know that you
sent me and have loved them as

62
00:03:34,561 --> 00:03:36,091
you have loved me.

63
00:03:36,415 --> 00:03:41,785
Father, I want those you have
given me to be with me where I am,

64
00:03:41,755 --> 00:03:43,325
and to see my glory,

65
00:03:43,488 --> 00:03:48,478
the glory you have given me
because you loved me before the

66
00:03:48,048 --> 00:03:49,698
creation of the world.

67
00:03:50,615 --> 00:03:55,585
Righteous Father, though the world
does not know you, I know you,

68
00:03:55,488 --> 00:03:58,058
and they know that
you have sent me.

69
00:03:58,501 --> 00:04:03,551
I have made you known to them, and
will continue to make you known

70
00:04:03,835 --> 00:04:04,605
Hi.

71
00:04:04,735 --> 00:04:05,525
Hi.

72
00:04:06,984 --> 00:04:10,954
in order that the love you
have for me may be in them,

73
00:04:10,864 --> 00:04:13,574
and that I myself may be in them.

74
00:04:14,511 --> 00:04:19,261
He prayed for them. And for
everyone who would believe through

75
00:04:18,831 --> 00:04:19,921
their message.
